{"title":"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b0012b2744dd38ebfc6b2eab9975e89c30ba5872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{64} + \\sqrt{36}}{\\sqrt{64 + 36}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"95\" height=\"48\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e9649272fcdf20d9af596fe4c7bbc8e43c569ecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{7}{5} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{16}{5} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{1}{5} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{24}{5} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\frac{14}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"435\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a669020f046e0d73f9a0074a51fec03d699a8688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{64} + \\sqrt{36}}{\\sqrt{64 + 36}} = \\frac{8 + 6}{\\sqrt{100}} = \\frac{14}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"212\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d3787d063a715c29d4bd2da059ffea1716657769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14 \\div 2}{10 \\div 2} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{7}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"140\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.1\">Solution 1.1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can remember that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53c4392f1f7f8432c5ca9be7fd4ea6bb5c043e21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2 + 8^2 = 10^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" /> using pythagorean triples. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/2/242bade7eecb8dbe7d1ef62e8008cfb581dbe77d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2 = 36$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15ab925f4c11a0035ece4b71b1e5644fd6496d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^2 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25d8b272fd74f3bbee13ea8f55cbc8fb2b04e3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8 + 6}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"46\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Using the same process as solution 1, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d54cf1c399cd9e9bee3d0f2d7006817609f184c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{7}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"62\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal\">2007 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b